  "description": "24 Páirc Mhuire, Tullow, Co. Carlow\nTwo-Bedroom Residence in a Prime Residential Location\nEircode: R93 CF29\nREA Dawson are delighted to present this Pleasant two-bedroom property to the market. Maintained in good condition throughout, the property would benefit from some modernisation, offering purchasers an excellent opportunity to create a home tailored to their own style and requirements.\nNo. 24 Páirc Mhuire offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation extending throughout the property, together with a generous enclosed rear yard. This home is ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a conveniently located family residence.\nLocation\n24 Páirc Mhuire is a well-established and highly regarded development in Tullow, within walking distance of Tullow market square. The area offers convenient access to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, schools, restaurants, sports facilities, and regular bus services to Dublin and Carlow.\nApproximate Distances:\nCarlow Town: 15km\nM9 Motorway (Junction 5): 11km\nDublin: 80km\n \nAccommodation\nKitchen: (1.7 x 3.4 m2)\nFitted wall and floor and sink units\n \nLiving Room: (4.7 x 2.7 m2)\nFitted carpet floor\n \nSitting Room (3.2 x 4.5 m2)\nOpen fireplace with stone surround\n \nUtility (5.3 x 3.6m2)\nLarge utility area with WC WHB, shower room and plumbing for washing machine.\n \nFirst Floor\nBedroom No. 1: (4.5 x 3.2 m2)\nFitted carpet floor and built in wardrobes\n \nBedroom No. 2: (3.1 x 3.1 m2)\nFitted carpet floor and built in wardrobes\n \nFamily Bathroom: (1.8 x 1.7 m2)\nWC, WHB, bath with overhead shower.\n \nGarage/Storage Shed (2.4 x 4.8m2)\nOutside:\nEnclosed back garden with rear access to the property.\n \nFeatures:\nHighly sought-after residential location\nWithin walking distance of Tullow tow Centre\n \nDirections: R93 CF29\nViewing strictly by appointment only.",
